build/
*.uf2
*.elf
*.bin
*.hex
*.dsk
*.po
*.2mg

# ...but the released demo disk is tracked
!disk/*.dsk

# ...and the SP0256 firmware. Unlike the DECtalk build it is GPL-3 with its
# complete corresponding source in this repository, so its binaries can be
# distributed -- which is the whole point of shipping them. The pattern is
# deliberately narrow: it cannot match a DECtalk build, so the blanket *.uf2
# ignore above still protects against committing one by accident.
!firmware/perfectpaul2-sp0256-*.uf2
